Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for generateConcepts. Propose distinct concepts using the shop’s supplied capabilities and approved materials. Explain appearance, cost, durability, and lead-time tradeoffs without claiming unsupported performance; preserve essential customer constraints across creative alternatives. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
